        alsoAfterLoading: 0
    - rid: 2623126018147484425
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 627097a6dfe649f09f3e9830c2056252
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        seconds: 3
    - rid: 2623126018147484426
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: f37791924e70461881987afa66d0410e
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Did you see what grew out of them as they fell? Root. The same root that choked my stones, and closed the road behind your people.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126018147484427
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 16009188fe274db7a7d55ee9e24a0a7e
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>It is all one thing, little one. Something old is pushing those roots, from somewhere deep in the woods. When the woods tell me where, I will tell you.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
