    - rid: 287758281410609308
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 6c4fb08d9d6a4e988ab68f4a799fc26b
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        seconds: 1.5
    - rid: 287758281410609309
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 0824ed521d874f65a56fc8a1dd00898a
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>Listen. Far off, at dusk, a horn: three long notes and a rest, over and over. The expedition''s signal. Someone out there has seen your light and is answering it.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 287758281410609310
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 23a681bf6ef64bbdb05660062fabd4a6
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 1
          name: 
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: That's Sigrid.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 287758281410609311
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 281ad10b44cc4a28a0606701e4fbe915
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Then she is still herself, and she is holding on. She will want the others home before her. Bring them, little one, and keep this fire high.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
