  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::StoryScript
  nodes:
  - rid: 2623126038171615456
  - rid: 2623126038171615457
  - rid: 2623126038171615458
  - rid: 2623126038171615459
  - rid: 2623126268168110199
  - rid: 2623126268168110200
  - rid: 2623126268168110201
  - rid: 2623126268168110202
  links:
  - from: 2e8de9b6b33347a0b4965e1cc0e0cdbe
    output: 0
    to: 1a5dc93acd52491a8c4ecf004e71abab
  - from: 1a5dc93acd52491a8c4ecf004e71abab
    output: 0
    to: 8e87cf68479a45b4bb22142d2466efa7
  - from: 8e87cf68479a45b4bb22142d2466efa7
    output: 0
    to: 70c408b327144db1b25e60e75d1f9169
  - from: 70c408b327144db1b25e60e75d1f9169
    output: 0
    to: 455fddbaedf144f4b0e389e239436595
  - from: 455fddbaedf144f4b0e389e239436595
    output: 0
    to: 3848b6fbfe5143518072e1e3c081da1a
  - from: 3848b6fbfe5143518072e1e3c081da1a
    output: 0
    to: c459904c4e584d0790c3da8ba9142764
  - from: c459904c4e584d0790c3da8ba9142764
    output: 0
    to: 7f52db49eb2e45c39c6caf55f44af22f
  logSteps: 0
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 2623126038171615456
      type: {class: WhenQuest, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 2e8de9b6b33347a0b4965e1cc0e0cdbe
        position: {x: 40, y: 60}
        once: 1
        quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 43d140c7ce0db8248af73e619971f999, type: 2}
        when: 1
        alsoAfterLoading: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615457
      type: {class: WaitNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 1a5dc93acd52491a8c4ecf004e71abab
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        seconds: 2
    - rid: 2623126038171615458
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8e87cf68479a45b4bb22142d2466efa7
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: I've kept something to myself since the day the stones broke. I'm done keeping it.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615459
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 70c408b327144db1b25e60e75d1f9169
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Before we went in, I touched the middle stone. There were names cut into it, fresh, as if someone had only just carved them. Sigrun's was one of them.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126268168110199
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 455fddbaedf144f4b0e389e239436595
        position: {x: 1180, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: I thought it was a list of the dead. I told no one, because I didn't want it to be true.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126268168110200
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 3848b6fbfe5143518072e1e3c081da1a
        position: {x: 1420, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>It was not a list. The names were not a sentence. They were a warning.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126268168110201
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: c459904c4e584d0790c3da8ba9142764
        position: {x: 1660, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Every name on that stone is someone the hunger has taken, or means to. The toll at the Brukam's bridge was never paid, little one. That debt comes due at the First Hearth.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126268168110202
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 7f52db49eb2e45c39c6caf55f44af22f
        position: {x: 1900, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Then that's where we go.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
