  - rid: 2623126292842152070
  links:
  - from: 1433842ce567ac3d6660abffe2ac5a1c
    output: 0
    to: 3a29ca83162c4a43860a5fe3d1c897e6
  - from: 3a29ca83162c4a43860a5fe3d1c897e6
    output: 0
    to: 4ef975bd5c75478fac7d0c036f828431
  - from: 4ef975bd5c75478fac7d0c036f828431
    output: 0
    to: 8484dc37dc8d4d8280193c4ceee6b010
  - from: 8484dc37dc8d4d8280193c4ceee6b010
    output: 0
    to: 90c019b390204d7caece3f638bf593b5
  - from: 90c019b390204d7caece3f638bf593b5
    output: 0
    to: 4b318ca3c54a41d19987d71a28345269
  - from: 4b318ca3c54a41d19987d71a28345269
    output: 0
    to: 5c46c6ad39014957b0212c90eddf9a72
  - from: 4b318ca3c54a41d19987d71a28345269
    output: 1
    to: ec2244a76ac245a89bd95e6583f2ba02
  - from: 5c46c6ad39014957b0212c90eddf9a72
    output: 0
    to: a33f7af90a844608a5a47cf885ad9084
  - from: ec2244a76ac245a89bd95e6583f2ba02
    output: 0
    to: 5c46c6ad39014957b0212c90eddf9a72
  logSteps: 0
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 2623126292842152062
      type: {class: WhenQuestEvent, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 1433842ce567ac3d6660abffe2ac5a1c
        position: {x: 40, y: 60}
        once: 1
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ce1ddb6c97c72ca4e9e8fbb84821867b, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126292842152063
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 3a29ca83162c4a43860a5fe3d1c897e6
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99c5d79ee033bdd4e972d87f29967ca6, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126292842152064
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4ef975bd5c75478fac7d0c036f828431
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Little one. You have gone through me and come home, again and again. Each time you go, I hold the way open behind you. Each time, it costs me.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126292842152065
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8484dc37dc8d4d8280193c4ceee6b010
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>Feel my stones: loose, where the roots held them for so long. I am a door that opens only a little way, into the near woods, where the mist is thin and young.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126292842152066
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 90c019b390204d7caece3f638bf593b5
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>Further in, the mist is older. What lives there is stronger and hungrier, and so is what it keeps: better ore, older wood, and people who have waited longer than the ones you have found.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126292842152067
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4b318ca3c54a41d19987d71a28345269
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>I can open the deeper way. But not as I am.</i>
        answers:
        - What do you need?
        - What will it cost you?
        mustAnswer: 1
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 2623126292842152068
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5c46c6ad39014957b0212c90eddf9a72
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Steady my stones. Bring what they ask and lay it in me, here, and raise me. Each time I am raised, a deeper tier of the woods opens, and I hold the way home open longer while you are out there.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126292842152069
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ec2244a76ac245a89bd95e6583f2ba02
        position: {x: 1840, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>Strength, which you will give me. And this: what is strong draws the hungry. The deeper I open, the more the forest will feel this fire. Keep your walls in good repair.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126292842152070
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: a33f7af90a844608a5a47cf885ad9084
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>Once I am raised, the choice is yours each time you set out: the near woods, or the deeper ones. Go deeper when you are ready for what lives there, not before.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
