  - rid: 2623126038171615469
  - rid: 2623126038171615470
  links:
  - from: 8f00299259f544a1acec9917d34d9885
    output: 0
    to: 6673c2a340154773b863d252a989f9b2
  - from: 6673c2a340154773b863d252a989f9b2
    output: 0
    to: d58f26b1366b4dbb889b0da8c0949030
  - from: d58f26b1366b4dbb889b0da8c0949030
    output: 0
    to: 95c5b3566a4643b894ebbac4f579cd88
  - from: 95c5b3566a4643b894ebbac4f579cd88
    output: 0
    to: 9e15328494a3415e86143e5eb9b00de8
  - from: 9e15328494a3415e86143e5eb9b00de8
    output: 0
    to: 267ec2a69bdd48e09c1bc48622f28673
  - from: 267ec2a69bdd48e09c1bc48622f28673
    output: 0
    to: e80ee0b114b8467984f03f11174810a4
  - from: 267ec2a69bdd48e09c1bc48622f28673
    output: 1
    to: 5e9036fde5df4bd4b182b021357598ce
  - from: e80ee0b114b8467984f03f11174810a4
    output: 0
    to: d91b1e67b36b4c938b44f81af8095ec3
  - from: 5e9036fde5df4bd4b182b021357598ce
    output: 0
    to: d91b1e67b36b4c938b44f81af8095ec3
  - from: d91b1e67b36b4c938b44f81af8095ec3
    output: 0
    to: 166b1b61e22040ca80a7b942d415b187
  - from: 166b1b61e22040ca80a7b942d415b187
    output: 0
    to: 9eb1c69692e44d0b9d1a85651fcc4940
  logSteps: 0
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 2623126038171615460
      type: {class: WhenQuestEvent, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8f00299259f544a1acec9917d34d9885
        position: {x: 40, y: 60}
        once: 1
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7afe977d216ff04db89c5ac4f5eec2c, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126038171615461
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 6673c2a340154773b863d252a989f9b2
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>Your fire reaches further than it did, little one. Far enough that I can feel what lies at the end of it: stones, cold ones, out past the meadows.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615462
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: d58f26b1366b4dbb889b0da8c0949030
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>When the pact was kept, your people did not only tend a hearth beside me. They walked the land the pact gave them, and where it ended they set stones, and lit them from this fire.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615463
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 95c5b3566a4643b894ebbac4f579cd88
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>A lit stone said: this much of the forest remembers a hearth. Inside that ring nobody lost the way home, and nobody lost their name.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615464
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 9e15328494a3415e86143e5eb9b00de8
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>When the hearth went cold, the stones went cold, one by one. The forest took back what they held, and every road and every name in it. That is where your people are now: out in the land that forgot us.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615465
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 267ec2a69bdd48e09c1bc48622f28673
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>The stones are still out there. They only want a hand that keeps a fire.</i>
        answers:
        - Then I'll light them again.
        - Won't the forest want the land back?
        mustAnswer: 1
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 2623126038171615466
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: e80ee0b114b8467984f03f11174810a4
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>Good. Not all of them, and not all at once: only what you can hold.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615467
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5e9036fde5df4bd4b182b021357598ce
        position: {x: 1840, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>It will. The pact gave the forest its room as well, and that is the one thing it has not forgotten. It will push against every stone you light. Hold what you take, and in time it leaves it be.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615468
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: d91b1e67b36b4c938b44f81af8095ec3
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Find one of the places a stone remembers, so that it knows you, then lay your hand on it. The first will answer to my fire alone. The rest want a Pact Rune, the pact's own mark, scattered through the woods since it broke.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615469
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 166b1b61e22040ca80a7b942d415b187
        position: {x: 2440, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Every land you hold is a road home for whoever is still out there, and a door shut on what comes at night. Begin with the nearest stone.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615470
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 9eb1c69692e44d0b9d1a85651fcc4940
        position: {x: 2740, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c2d9213512795eb438f011f5cbb433ab, type: 2}
