      propertyPath: ruinText
      value: 'The stones that dropped you here, cracked and cold. A faint hum lingers in them, and under it a voice you know. Three Life Orbs would wake them: the rootbound stones around the clearing still hold some.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
