--- !u!114 &1038728954
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1038728950}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 15a260b2b7c4f264f890791a63a9db9b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HeartTree
  questWhispers:
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 74cd46b9fddfdd747857eb1796e3be5d, type: 2}
    text: <i>Bring what my stones ask and lay it in me, then raise me. The deeper woods are waiting, and so are the ones lost in them.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ce1ddb6c97c72ca4e9e8fbb84821867b, type: 2}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bb2c787a2de76634ba9260ee402850fc, type: 2}
    text: <i>Find a place that a stone remembers, then lay your hand on the stone. The nearest stands not far past the meadows.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a7afe977d216ff04db89c5ac4f5eec2c, type: 2}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eebb289a3dca56448b8f1e8823cc1ca8, type: 2}
    text: <i>A held land asks something of you now and then, and its stone will tell you what. A Pact Rune laid in the stone holds it better still.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1c7d13324b2d62e439e3f962ee7f050a, type: 2}
    text: <i>The forest is gathering against your stone, little one. Stand watch beside it, or burn the rot's heart on a raid. It will not wait for you.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 56c6112e347c2994db25d8808b5e4599, type: 2}
    text: <i>What you carry through me, the woods can take from you. What you leave here, I keep. Build a chest beside your workshop (G), and put in it what you cannot bear to lose.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1f3262601d6fae14abe8db6df70ed0b4, type: 2}
    text: '<i>One weapon is one answer, and it will not last for ever. Make a second at your workshop: a club stuns what a blade only cuts.</i>'
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9ffed2822f546824fa97d9d34216d5d5, type: 2}
    text: <i>Now feed yourself. Berries, water from the stream, a stew over your fire. You will be walking people home.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 449fc8864f45d83459f6ef5d2c3d8ea8, type: 2}
    text: '<i>You brought the woods home on your back. Now make something of them: a lodge by the trees, a saw that turns logs into planks. The smithy and the walls start with a plank.</i>'
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d215378a9433ba6498ac63dfe30d9cc4, type: 2}
    text: <i>My ward keeps out the worst of the forest, not all of it. Put a wall between your fire and the trees.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b95103f99c217d3489eb46bd97d706d8, type: 2}
    text: '<i>One fire brought Ingrid home. The others will want more than a fire: a bench, a furnace, a dry place to set down what they carry. Build what they will need.</i>'
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 95972d06dba0fda4bb5e87bc047956d1, type: 2}
    text: <i>The brighter this place burns, the further it can be seen. Build. Clear the old growth. Give them something worth walking towards.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 826f30ec0fdf5f64388ccd2b2b1a0470, type: 2}
    text: '<i>Bare hands bring little home, little one. A hatchet in your belt and a pick beside it bring wood and ore. Sticks and sharp stones: make them in your bag (B).</i>'
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3943d408532d51649b066fb789a31c5b, type: 2}
    text: '<i>You have a fire. Now a roof to work under: a workshop beside it (G). What the woods break, it mends.</i>'
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f7e615034e347bc438f7fdf1f08bd615, type: 2}
    text: <i>She is close, little one. Just beyond me, off the path, hiding. Find her, keep her near you, and bring her through.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c52d9c22e1f9f5d4099a9125d93cca82, type: 2}
    text: <i>Listen. A hammer, far off in the deep woods, slow and uneven. One of yours. Ask me what the woods hold before you go, and I will tell you where.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 443ebd34d5dd1174088e0e4c3deaf1d2, type: 2}
    text: <i>A saw, out where nobody saws. Your carpenter is hurt, but he is still measuring.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8405c6b53bec41a4fbed383421c499ef, type: 2}
    text: <i>Something tests my ward. Out there, someone else is holding a clearing against the wolves. Bring him to hold mine.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 243140468b973e440ac441a6ef36f475, type: 2}
    text: <i>A snare line, a mile of it, and at the end a man who did not mean to be caught.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f0b5dc009594d6740a78f57136d0d7dd, type: 2}
    text: <i>Smoke from a farmstead that burned long ago. Someone kept the seed.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 95abf05250fadd245b9deb23ee2d8a95, type: 2}
    text: <i>Someone is cooking out there. The wolves can smell it. So can I.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 731e0d40a233f1542973718a0f2a3868, type: 2}
    text: <i>Marks on the trees that only the dark shows. Go through at night.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4b1260ad506cec048af4eef676229c08, type: 2}
    text: <i>Old stones are humming in the deep woods. Someone is inside the ring, writing.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 67762168d69ad5c45bdaf2fe6d96f1aa, type: 2}
    text: <i>A wall went up overnight out there, round nothing. Whoever built it will want to build a better one here.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 828a820b56a0a1b4985cc22166bc450a, type: 2}
    text: <i>A horn at dusk, the expedition's signal. She is the last of them. Bring her home, little one.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 00e21ff059394a4459d8cec92bc2d489, type: 2}
    text: <i>Listen, little one. Rest your hand on the stone.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3795709c84a5d1f4fa37ecf3e7b170a1, type: 2}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f89173a9aeb790c4f9aeb1cc56e0e655, type: 2}
    text: '<i>A fire first, little one. Fallen branches and loose stones lie all around me: pick them up, open the build menu (G) and light it inside my ward. The sooner it burns, the sooner they can see it.</i>'
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8fd8f4db8a0b4d74cb71c5b4837010ac, type: 2}
    text: <i>The forest has put its roots in even here. Three stones around the clearing still hold my light, choked and cold. Free them, and bring the Life Orbs back.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2614c1d189f3a034691f98f3d3efeee0, type: 2}
    text: <i>Now bring me what you freed. Feed me that light and I will open for you, as I did in the dark.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 08ed06b5fb8d1854c86788aa2a00156f, type: 2}
    text: <i>Go, little one. She is just beyond me, off the path. Come back through one of my doors before I close. What you wear I can always bring home. What you carry I cannot.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fea0201f13773f04a96efbcb5b364ea9, type: 2}
    text: <i>The light that reached her reached other things as well. They are on the old path now, testing me. Prepare yourself. When you are ready, tell me, and I will let them come.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5b96808e29f58414c97811c3ec9f1a0a, type: 2}
    text: <i>Something breathes under the roots, little one. I feel it turn over in its sleep, deep in the Misty Woods, but I cannot see where. Find it for me. Walk into its hollow and come home, and I will know the way.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 002e81b2272f9d94ba3274891dd390d6, type: 2}
    text: '<i>Now I know the way. It is a guardian, as old as my stones, and it will not wake for steel. Take an ember from your own fire to it. That, it cannot ignore. And come ready, little one: beyond my mist there is no turning back.</i>'
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 974fa4eab9d545645a9733f74c28fbcd, type: 2}
    text: '<i>Listen, little one. The guardian is old wood, and old wood fears one thing: fire. The trees out there weep a black sap when they fall. Boil it down around an ember from your hearth, and every blow you strike will burn.</i>'
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bd7dd70969be8174c8acfefd449bf963, type: 2}
    text: <i>Come and sit by me, little one. There is something I should have told you before you went to that hollow.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44f42630a316f7f4993be640f28deba3, type: 2}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1090953ec0461964394a6ccdbe619504, type: 2}
    text: <i>North of the valley the old road goes on, little one, but I cannot see past its last bridge, at the valley's head. Something sits there that the trolls themselves pay. Go and look, and come home, and I will know the way.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  - quest: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5e68f3e2a126b6442ad860bda020e064, type: 2}
    text: <i>Now I know whose bridge it is. He was old when my stones were raised, and he has never let anyone cross for free. He waits on his own bridge over the gorge now. Go ready, or do not go.</i>
    moment: {fileID: 0}
  whispers:
  - <i>Every hearth in my light is a little more of the old pact kept.</i>
  - <i>The forest cannot forget a place that someone tends.</i>
  - <i>I listen for your people every night. Some nights I hear them.</i>
  - <i>A hundred winters I kept this clearing alone. I had forgotten how loud a home is. Do not stop.</i>
  questTarget: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e835c314791108c43b5172c1cc4a57fd, type: 2}
  talkedEvent: {fileID: 0}
  voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
  wardRing: {fileID: 313313493}
  ringSegments: 96
  menuRange: 8
  buildReach: 165
  buildUnevenness: 0.5
