    to: c8c6bafb42b9476db94f8fb142b3ad02
  - from: c8c6bafb42b9476db94f8fb142b3ad02
    output: 0
    to: ccdf26567bb14e13a01d9ce48d0a37b1
  - from: c8c6bafb42b9476db94f8fb142b3ad02
    output: 1
    to: b3b68c26a6c5494c9aa6f46b97316063
  - from: b3b68c26a6c5494c9aa6f46b97316063
    output: 0
    to: 528815942c4341e784314cc92d4a9d99
  - from: b3b68c26a6c5494c9aa6f46b97316063
    output: 1
    to: bce621b450e44e00939fb833b688aacd
  - from: 5e5ad246f223421f9088c5ae2c7a7b2b
    output: 0
    to: bce621b450e44e00939fb833b688aacd
  - from: ccdf26567bb14e13a01d9ce48d0a37b1
    output: 0
    to: bce621b450e44e00939fb833b688aacd
  - from: 528815942c4341e784314cc92d4a9d99
    output: 0
    to: bce621b450e44e00939fb833b688aacd
  - from: bce621b450e44e00939fb833b688aacd
    output: 0
    to: ca71dc088408441e8b0475e397e46504
  - from: ca71dc088408441e8b0475e397e46504
    output: 0
    to: 529e8a4a9a834bdebcc297b073742eae
  logSteps: 0
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 2623126018147484409
      type: {class: WhenQuestEvent, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 4c14a74fce334c9fa536f2540f560938
        position: {x: 40, y: 60}
        once: 1
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 44f42630a316f7f4993be640f28deba3, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126018147484410
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 3c7fe6a1e43241c0b02990cfb3aeb498
        position: {x: 340, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>You brought it down. Lay what you carried out of the hollow by the fire, little one, where it can feel the warmth. It is owed that much.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126018147484411
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 127e3032adcf427eab7fc9f005c0ac38
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>I have not told you everything. The Heartroot was no monster. It was the forest''s guardian: its half of the pact. Your kind let the hearth beside me go cold a hundred winters ago. It kept its half for ninety winters after that, alone, until the hunger got into its roots.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126018147484412
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 0a3d98d16fc64ce886f84e5a341540c8
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>That is what you killed. I am sorry. Someone had to.</i>
        answers:
        - Then we broke the pact first.
        - Why didn't you tell me?
        mustAnswer: 1
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 2623126018147484413
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 3d8618ee4fee4c1ebc7a9ba8d8238df6
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Your people did, long before you were born. You are mending it. Every fire kept here is a payment on that debt.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126018147484414
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 7b10092daba8439b9bc63d3857982dcd
        position: {x: 1240, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Would you have woken it, knowing? It could not be saved, only stopped. Better by the hand of someone who keeps a hearth.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126018147484415
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: c656f995332d423ea5765e9a36af141b
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 052e1548b0a161348bb7cf591b4333f7, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126018147484416
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5e5ad246f223421f9088c5ae2c7a7b2b
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>You came for coin. There is none in this. But there is a debt now, and you have begun to pay it.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126018147484417
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: c8c6bafb42b9476db94f8fb142b3ad02
        position: {x: 1840, y: 230}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f1a0301acf429304ba7ad3d189da48bb, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126018147484418
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ccdf26567bb14e13a01d9ce48d0a37b1
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>You came for someone. Every one of your people is out there because of what was let go cold. Bring them home, and the debt grows smaller.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126018147484419
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: b3b68c26a6c5494c9aa6f46b97316063
        position: {x: 2140, y: 230}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1426971087cd5fb408c55293cb5e4e12, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623126018147484420
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 528815942c4341e784314cc92d4a9d99
        position: {x: 2440, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: '<i>You came to see if the stories were true. Here is the one nobody tells: we broke the pact first.</i>'
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126018147484421
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: bce621b450e44e00939fb833b688aacd
        position: {x: 2440, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Its last word was for you. Hearth-keeper. Nobody has called anyone that in a hundred winters, and I did not teach it to you. One day you will tell me why these stones woke for your hand.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126018147484422
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ca71dc088408441e8b0475e397e46504
        position: {x: 2740, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>With its roots gone quiet I can reach further. North, past the troll country, the road is open. The old one that broke my stones the night you fell walks that road. It came for the door then. Go carefully.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615445
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 529e8a4a9a834bdebcc297b073742eae
        position: {x: 3040, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0ed9c93a1e761a74abc40f52616bfb57, type: 2}
