        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126038171615459
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: d76088ee3dac47daa13ef291a181bf1d
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The man in grey
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: I opened a door like this once. I thought I could pull them through. The hunger came out instead.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126268168110203
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 17183a9ba46141b3a7c6d4c86e065c8b
        position: {x: 1180, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The man in grey
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: I ran. I left a village behind me with its names half eaten. I have been opening doors ever since, as if the next one would make it right.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126268168110204
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: a4f4f4f78ad741d98b0949e39c51ba11
        position: {x: 1420, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The man in grey
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: There was a note on the table. Old Bear, find the blue door. She called me that when she wanted something.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126268168110205
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 0f5d0ab7aaff4b36a88ba53d366fc95c
        position: {x: 1660, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The man in grey
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: I opened it a hand's width and heard her humming, and I closed it. If it had been her, she would have said Father. She only said that when she was frightened.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126268168110206
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 71fcece5a49543199794b1c60c93afc6
        position: {x: 1900, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>He chose the closed door. That choice may be all he has left of them.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623126268168110207
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 1e9ee4cb9bcc40f3a416ce1e19de6445
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: The Portal
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8aef6fe04075b604a8ffeaaef324344f, type: 2}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 1038728947}
        line: <i>Keep the horse. Something has to remember them, and he cannot carry it any more.</i>
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
